WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:21.320
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:26.100
Hanasakeru Seishonen

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:35.650
Hero's Welcome

00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:45.790
Your Highness, we'll be above Raginei in 45 minutes.

00:01:47.570 --> 00:01:49.590
I thought I'd be more anxious but...

00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:54.880
...I feel really calm. 
 I don't even know if they'll let me in or not.

00:01:56.120 --> 00:01:59.350
I just want to be close to the Palace.

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:02.000
That's all I'm thinking about.

00:02:04.130 --> 00:02:07.780
- I told you guys that I'll make time for you later.
- I don't mind.

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:13.510
How gracious of you Prince Rumaty, you're quite different from the others.

00:02:14.140 --> 00:02:18.240
- When you become the king, please give us an exclusive interview.
- Eddie!

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:24.000
According to my sources, there are 100,000 troops at the airport. 
 How are you going to deal with that?

00:02:25.070 --> 00:02:28.980
I don't want them to panic, but I want a chance to talk directly to the citizens.

00:02:29.650 --> 00:02:31.020
Would you be able to prepare it?

00:02:32.150 --> 00:02:34.750
But, you'll be be in danger Your Highness!

00:02:34.870 --> 00:02:38.520
Actually, I think the military can't make a move fearing pandemonium.

00:02:38.890 --> 00:02:42.260
That's right. 
 The palace will probably approach him cautiously.

00:02:42.290 --> 00:02:46.900
- No, no, it's dangerous! 
- I want to take the least aggressive path.

00:02:47.450 --> 00:02:51.370
And I want the people to know that too. 
 Also the chamberlains too.

00:02:52.320 --> 00:02:57.360
- I just want to avoid a civil war.
- Why don't you use the plaza in front of the airport?

00:02:57.780 --> 00:03:03.220
- Alright we'll contact them!
- This is going to make the headlines! - It's a big deal!

00:03:04.900 --> 00:03:09.990
- Your Highness.
- "If I poke a hole in the leadership, the world will change."

00:03:10.570 --> 00:03:14.270
People that think like that will be here till the end of the days.

00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:19.270
Anyway, I will be cautious about them, but I won't fear them.

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:22.180
I don't plan on retaliating either.

00:03:23.810 --> 00:03:28.010
Even the selfish chamberlains were the ones running the country.

00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:32.240
If I approach them they'll change their minds too.

00:03:33.240 --> 00:03:36.970
Even if I help my brother or Izmal, the people won't agree.

00:03:38.140 --> 00:03:41.320
Anyway, Lee-Leng is waiting for me over there.

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:44.840
Zao, what are you going to say to Lee-Leng?

00:03:51.550 --> 00:03:53.070
Lee-Leng Huang is?!

00:03:54.340 --> 00:03:56.450
What do you mean Harris?! Tell me!

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:59.030
Please be quiet, Master Isabelle.

00:03:59.220 --> 00:04:01.170
Get out of my way!

00:04:01.460 --> 00:04:04.350
- I can't let you through.
- What?!

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:08.980
I'm sorry that I couldn't contact you for a while.

00:04:09.590 --> 00:04:12.190
As long as Kajika is OK.

00:04:12.650 --> 00:04:14.370
What do you have to tell me?

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:18.070
You should leave Raginei with Kajika as soon as you can.

00:04:18.890 --> 00:04:24.190
That was our plan, but with the return of Rumaty, the area around the airport is too chaotic.

00:04:24.770 --> 00:04:28.870
- It's too dangerous to leave with her now.
- So you're going to stay here?!

00:04:29.650 --> 00:04:32.220
Until the crowds calm down.

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:37.230
I'm going to return to the States while my father is in stable condition.

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:40.210
I can take Kajika with me too.

00:04:41.020 --> 00:04:43.880
No, I don't think Kajika wishes that.

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:48.810
You can't leave the Huangs alone either, right?

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:53.370
I'll say this because you'll hear me out.

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:55.160
I'm going to---

00:04:56.940 --> 00:05:00.220
- Master Isabelle! 
 - I have a guest!

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:06.390
I know! What does a henchman of Burnsworth want?!

00:05:06.690 --> 00:05:10.810
- Are you here to sneer at my father?!
- What--- what kind of foolish...

00:05:13.420 --> 00:05:14.990
...Just be quiet!

00:05:16.010 --> 00:05:17.470
I apologize.

00:05:17.840 --> 00:05:20.090
My sister is panicking right now.

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:24.970
Don't worry about it. Your dad is going through a lot.

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:30.870
I tried to stop her. 
 I'm sorry.

00:05:31.290 --> 00:05:34.570
I actually felt sorry for Carl.

00:05:44.880 --> 00:05:49.400
- What's wrong?
- Do soldiers come to this hospital often?

00:05:50.110 --> 00:05:52.540
- Soldiers?
- I really don't see them much but...

00:05:53.390 --> 00:05:56.400
...Don't soldiers stay at the military hospital?

00:05:57.270 --> 00:06:01.840
<i>How strange. 
I felt animosity from that man.</i>

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:05.270
I don't care what you say to me.

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:09.630
Don't disgrace the Rosenthal name anymore!

00:06:12.110 --> 00:06:14.130
How dare you talk to me like that!

00:06:14.320 --> 00:06:17.080
You put my father through all that...

00:06:17.210 --> 00:06:20.780
...you have no right to talk to me like that!

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:26.010
Duck!

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:33.650
- Stop it! 
 - Carl!

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:45.820
Are you alright Carl?!

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:49.710
- It just nicked me. 
- Master Carl!

00:06:50.630 --> 00:06:55.250
- Get that guy! He won't die with just that! 
- Yes, sir!

00:06:56.950 --> 00:07:00.460
He's gone.
 It had poison in it.

00:07:01.490 --> 00:07:05.660
Is the Palace trying to get to us using soldiers as their assassins?!

00:07:06.390 --> 00:07:07.550
It's no joke!

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:12.250
I've done nothing for them to send an assassin!

00:07:13.970 --> 00:07:19.280
Assassin?! From the Palace?!
 Sent to kill me?!

00:07:19.920 --> 00:07:24.770
Sister?! 
 If you know anything tell me now!

00:07:26.280 --> 00:07:28.220
If we don't do anything, they're going to come again!

00:07:28.320 --> 00:07:33.390
It's Quinza!
 Since I know Kajika's secret!

00:07:34.460 --> 00:07:35.770
Secret?!

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:41.650
- I can't believe it! Why would he?!
- What did you tell Quinza?!

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:47.630
It's all your fault Carl! 
 It's because you betrayed my father!

00:07:47.970 --> 00:07:51.320
That's why I told Quinza Kajika's lineage!

00:07:56.280 --> 00:08:00.590
- It's because you betrayed my father! 
- Master Carl!

00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:03.340
Carl! I'm going to take your car!

00:08:03.820 --> 00:08:07.230
- Wait! I'll go too! 
- You can't! Not with that wound!

00:08:07.660 --> 00:08:12.230
Let me go! Kajika will---Kajika will--- be killed!

00:08:16.170 --> 00:08:19.980
<i>What has happened! 
The infighting of the Rosenthals will...</i>

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:22.230
<i>...kill Kajika!</i>

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:26.920
Kajika! 
 Let me get there in time!

00:08:32.550 --> 00:08:35.780
Did Lee-Leng get to the airport yet?!

00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:39.230
I hope it doesn't turn into a mess.

00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:49.310
Now, all I have to do is get rid of this problem!

00:09:09.750 --> 00:09:13.720
Hanasakeru Seishonen

00:09:22.300 --> 00:09:24.020
This is more than I've imagined.

00:09:24.700 --> 00:09:27.710
If Rumaty comes here it'll be quite a scene.

00:09:28.320 --> 00:09:29.820
Eugene!

00:09:31.810 --> 00:09:34.800
- Noei!
- I wasn't expecting to see you here.

00:09:35.290 --> 00:09:39.370
- It's good that you stick out.
- Is the military going to move in?!

00:09:39.780 --> 00:09:44.660
No. They haven't been ordered in yet. Even if they were ordered, they won't move in.

00:09:49.390 --> 00:09:51.360
That's a lot of media.

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:54.010
There's a lot of TV cameras around.

00:09:54.540 --> 00:09:57.310
It's the triumphant return of the king. 
 It's quite the scene.

00:09:57.730 --> 00:10:00.720
- King?! 
 - He is already the king.

00:10:01.860 --> 00:10:06.180
It resonates even more if King Somand's mental state is as you told me.

00:10:07.510 --> 00:10:09.220
It's quite a difficult spot.

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:12.250
King Somand use to be your master, right?

00:10:12.680 --> 00:10:15.040
I'm actually relieved.

00:10:16.530 --> 00:10:18.800
People won't get executed anymore.

00:10:19.660 --> 00:10:24.520
I was afraid that there would be a revolution before His Highness Rumaty got back.

00:10:28.200 --> 00:10:30.490
It's me. 
 Did something happen?!

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:36.050
His Highness is going to make a speech?! 
 At this airport?!

00:10:38.180 --> 00:10:40.780
It's disrespectful to make him wait any longer!

00:10:41.710 --> 00:10:44.180
Are you going to allow his entry or not?!

00:10:44.400 --> 00:10:47.290
His Highness Rumaty has already been waiting in that plane for 30 minutes!

00:10:47.540 --> 00:10:53.320
- But neither the King nor the Head Chamberlain has said anything yet. 
 - How does the secret police see this?!

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:56.350
If the chief isn't here I really can't say anything.

00:10:57.540 --> 00:11:02.150
The church through the high priest has accepted his entry.

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:07.020
I can't trust the Palace. 
 With the cabinet being arrested today and all.

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:10.240
We were only following the orders of the King.

00:11:10.590 --> 00:11:15.240
You said you were ordered, but who's heard his direct orders?!

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:19.670
- Um I...
- So what is your decision?!

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:22.680
What conclusion has the Palace come to?!

00:11:23.380 --> 00:11:26.560
Take him to the hotel, temporarily.

00:11:26.980 --> 00:11:30.940
Minister of Defense and Army General Rezat!

00:11:31.570 --> 00:11:36.550
And even Navy Viceroy Lopas! 
 Is the military going to support His Highness Rumaty?!

00:11:37.220 --> 00:11:42.270
No. But it's a better idea than having him stuck on that plane.

00:11:42.440 --> 00:11:44.920
But, without getting authorization from above...

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:47.840
I will take the responsibility for this if anything happens.

00:11:48.150 --> 00:11:50.530
Anyway, we have to go greet him off the plane.

00:11:50.830 --> 00:11:54.440
- Let us come with you.
- We will come too!

00:11:58.820 --> 00:12:01.680
Finally, they're here.

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:07.340
- Where's His Highness? 
 - Over there. Please.

00:12:11.010 --> 00:12:15.160
It's been a while Minister of Defense, Rezat, and Lopas.

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:18.930
This man is---

00:12:19.290 --> 00:12:22.880
I affirm your welcoming. 
 How is my brother?

00:12:24.850 --> 00:12:28.170
Your Highness! 
 We're glad to have you back safely!

00:12:30.090 --> 00:12:34.590
Don't you remember that I was expelled from this country?!

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:37.890
Do you understand what it means to kneel before me?

00:12:38.350 --> 00:12:41.630
<i>He's a different person than two years ago!</i>

00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:45.130
<i>They won't even come close.</i>

00:12:46.020 --> 00:12:49.400
I see some of you belong to the Palace. 
 Good, listen to me.

00:12:50.320 --> 00:12:55.080
I don't wish for a civil war to break out. 
 I won't touch upon what happened two years ago.

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:59.750
- <i>I'm overwhelmed.</i> 
- I won't question you as long as you aid me.

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:02.170
That goes the same for my brother.

00:13:03.070 --> 00:13:05.870
I don't want to shed unnecessary blood.

00:13:06.190 --> 00:13:09.600
- <i>Who is this young man?!</i>
- Tell this to my brother.

00:13:10.460 --> 00:13:14.980
That I, Rumaty, will protect him!

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:17.690
He is already the king!

00:13:18.390 --> 00:13:22.500
I am planning to tell that to the people today!

00:13:23.930 --> 00:13:26.320
- You're not going to...
- I'll leave security up to you.

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:29.790
- You! - Yes, sir! 
 - Weren't you a part of the King's Army?

00:13:31.100 --> 00:13:34.540
But, I'm currently a part of the secret police.

00:13:34.630 --> 00:13:38.420
I don't care. 
 The duty of the King's Army is to protect the royalty.

00:13:39.510 --> 00:13:42.600
If you still have that pride in you.

00:13:43.330 --> 00:13:45.590
Yes, sir! 
 I will put my life on the line!

00:13:46.580 --> 00:13:49.920
- Chamberlains! 
- If it's the will of Your Highness!

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:53.590
<i>It's quite a spectacle to see the authority of the royalty of Raginei.</i>

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:58.050
If that's added with His Highness Rumaty's personal appeal...

00:13:58.720 --> 00:14:00.720
...even those opposed to him...

00:14:03.020 --> 00:14:08.880
...that leaves the speech. 
 There are many citizens that are against the kingship.

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:12.570
How will you take on the task, Your Highness?!

00:14:18.110 --> 00:14:20.030
What was that sound?!

00:14:24.740 --> 00:14:26.490
Hey what happened?!

00:14:35.280 --> 00:14:38.340
What is this gloomy feeling?

00:14:40.510 --> 00:14:41.810
Is anyone...

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:48.890
I came to get you, Master Kajika.

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:53.730
Please come with me.

00:14:55.030 --> 00:14:56.240
<i>Quinza!</i>

00:14:57.040 --> 00:15:01.090
Please hurry. 
 As you can see, it's dangerous here.

00:15:02.550 --> 00:15:05.040
Are those people dead?!

00:15:06.020 --> 00:15:08.790
<i>A voice inside me tells me not to go!</i>

00:15:09.430 --> 00:15:13.000
I'll explain it to you later. 
 Please hurry.

00:15:13.670 --> 00:15:14.910
<i>I can't go!</i>

00:15:16.280 --> 00:15:18.760
- <i>It's dangerous!</i> 
- Master Kajika!

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:25.550
Lee-Leng!

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:30.770
- -<i> It's unplugged!</i>
- Master Kajika!

00:15:32.050 --> 00:15:37.370
What's wrong? 
 I'm saddened that you'll doubt me.

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:40.840
Please, open the door.

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:44.530
Stop it Quinza! 
 Don't lie to me!

00:15:45.080 --> 00:15:48.260
- Lie? 
- Everything you say is a lie!

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:54.630
I can sense it! Horrible lies bring about bad fate! 
 Why would you do such a thing?

00:15:57.020 --> 00:16:00.240
Is that an ancient belief of Givoli Island?

00:16:01.480 --> 00:16:03.810
There's also another thing.

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:09.570
The reincarnation of the spirit. 
 Quite a unique belief.

00:16:10.340 --> 00:16:14.920
If the thoughts of the dead are too strong they don't go to heaven.

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:21.580
They try to reincarnate by entering someone that has a soul close to them.

00:16:23.720 --> 00:16:25.340
Don't worry.

00:16:26.010 --> 00:16:29.290
If we go by that, you'll be able to reincarnate.

00:16:29.900 --> 00:16:32.220
Even I, won't try to kill you twice.

00:16:33.110 --> 00:16:38.370
The only one I want to kill is Kajika Burnsworth's body!

00:16:43.430 --> 00:16:47.570
Why did I leave Kajika by herself today?!

00:16:48.590 --> 00:16:50.860
I shouldn't have left Kajika's side!

00:17:10.860 --> 00:17:12.200
I hope I'm not too late!

00:17:13.120 --> 00:17:17.610
Someone! Anyone! 
 Help Kajika!

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:21.690
I've never prayed to God before.

00:17:23.440 --> 00:17:27.680
But, listen to me! The God that protected this country for 1000 years!

00:17:28.350 --> 00:17:33.250
Please protect your beloved! 
 If a sacrifice is needed use me!

00:17:35.550 --> 00:17:40.420
She was supposed to be the one to listen to your words right by your side!

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:51.380
I slipped up! 
 I should have left weapons in the room.

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:56.670
I can't do anything about it now. 
 Toranosuke will be back soon.

00:17:56.950 --> 00:17:59.120
I have to do something until then!

00:18:45.980 --> 00:18:49.160
I know for sure they'll come to rescue me!

00:18:54.100 --> 00:18:57.280
- Until then...
- You're quite agile.

00:18:58.430 --> 00:19:00.920
Did you learn that in the Caribbean?

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:05.060
Quinza!
 <i>He already caught up.</i>

00:19:05.500 --> 00:19:08.780
Don't run away! 
 I guess it's useless for me to say that.

00:19:09.390 --> 00:19:12.830
The more you try to run, the more my aim won't be precise.

00:19:13.150 --> 00:19:15.150
The more chances I have of hurting you.

00:19:15.950 --> 00:19:19.450
I don't want to make you suffer before I kill you.

00:19:20.410 --> 00:19:23.400
Why Quinza! 
 I don't understand!

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:27.900
Why must you try to kill me?! 
 Rumaty is coming home!

00:19:28.090 --> 00:19:33.250
Today you're supposed to celebrate! 
 I'm on Rumaty's side too!

00:19:34.300 --> 00:19:38.220
- Why must you!
- That is exactly why.

00:19:39.140 --> 00:19:40.190
Quinza.

00:19:41.470 --> 00:19:46.630
<i>He knows?!</i>
 I'm not interested in the throne!

00:19:47.230 --> 00:19:51.630
Both my dad and I. 
 We just want to look after this country from afar!

00:19:53.120 --> 00:19:54.050
Why?

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:58.220
Did His Highness Machaty make such a mistake?!

00:19:59.150 --> 00:20:02.520
When the true king is about to be crowned...

00:20:03.730 --> 00:20:07.200
...why must the nightmares from the past come back to haunt us?!

00:20:07.910 --> 00:20:13.770
- Quin---
- Or am I getting tested with this?!

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:18.890
To test what I would do for the king!

00:20:34.150 --> 00:20:37.660
- I told you it's useless!
- God!

00:20:38.330 --> 00:20:41.510
But now I don't have to use my gun.

00:20:45.080 --> 00:20:47.240
You are a royalty.

00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:51.070
The royalty is the Sun God, Ragi.

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:55.620
It wasn't my will to kill you with a gun.

00:20:55.720 --> 00:20:59.130
- No!
- Don't worry Master Kajika.

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:03.300
- You will be able to go to the land of the Sun.
- Someone!

00:21:05.080 --> 00:21:09.610
- Lee-Leng! Lee-Leng!
- Please forgive me!

00:21:33.850 --> 00:21:36.270
- Lee-Leng!
- Kajika!

00:21:41.870 --> 00:21:43.980
Are you hurt?!

00:21:45.380 --> 00:21:50.130
- I'm alright. 
- I'm glad.

00:21:52.350 --> 00:21:54.840
- Lee-Leng.
- Kajika!

00:21:55.600 --> 00:22:00.730
I'm glad you're alive! 
 If you would have died I would've...

00:22:01.590 --> 00:22:06.340
Lee-Leng. 
 <i>Lee-Leng's body is shaking.</i>

00:22:07.420 --> 00:22:09.080
<i>How could this be? 
 Lee-Leng is trembling?!</i>

00:22:10.290 --> 00:22:13.280
<i>He must have thought that was the end.</i>

00:22:15.030 --> 00:22:19.690
<i>But I don't want it to end like this.</i>

00:22:20.580 --> 00:22:24.780
<i>I was just thinking I wanted to see him, one more time!</i>

00:22:26.150 --> 00:22:31.660
When I thought that I just saw you. I saw your face!

00:22:39.500 --> 00:22:41.920
<i>Can you hear it Lee-Leng?</i>

00:22:50.810 --> 00:22:53.200
<i>The sound of the waves.</i>

00:22:55.620 --> 00:22:59.180
<i>Finally we're home.</i>

00:23:01.640 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:23.730
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
